  "Solution": {
    "S": "Thermoplastics can be softened by heating and reshaped multiple times. Polyvinyl chloride (PVC) is a thermoplastic. Bakelite is thermosetting, Terylene is a polyester (thermosetting), and Neoprene is an elastomer. Therefore, the thermoplastic polymer is Polyvinyl, which corresponds to option A."
